DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41553::$$$message_0312_0000_0000$$$::"It goes without saying that these are the shrine maiden outfits."::
41554::$$$message_0312_0001_0000$$$::"By the way, I was surprised at how good Saber looks in this. Talk about 'East meets West.'"::
41555::$$$message_0312_0002_0000$$$::"You honor me. I do serve the gods, after all."::
41556::$$$message_0312_0003_0000$$$::"Hehehe.[br]I bet Shirou's happy to have all these variations."::
41557::$$$message_0312_0004_0000$$$::"R-Rin... What an indecent thing to say before the gods..."::
41558::$$$message_0312_0005_0000$$$::"Hehehe. Where do you think we are?"::
41559::$$$message_0312_0006_0000$$$::"Even crying children come to worship at the Tohsaka Shrine![br]You need to be honest with yourself or I won't give you a shrine maiden outfit in place of your wages!"::
41560::$$$message_0312_0007_0000$$$::"Ah, uh...that's... [br][cacheimage storage=セイバー巫女服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー巫女服01c(中)]...Oh, what about Rider and Sakura with their cute feet?"::
41561::$$$message_0312_0008_0000$$$::"The character artist fished these cartoons they drew out of the garbage bin."::
41562::$$$message_0312_0009_0000$$$::"They won't run amok in the streets or form a committee,[br]much less show up in the story."::
41563::$$$message_0312_0010_0000$$$::"Fan discs are monstrous places."::

